  "limitations": "Independent AI source review, not qualified human legal/tax/appraisal review, psychometric validation, measurement of item difficulty, or a prediction of exam performance. Primary source passages, not complete long reference manuals, were read. BOE assessment-specific income conventions were distinguished from explicitly stated market-investment conventions. Finite question banks still sample the domain. Normalized-stem three-gram similarity was only a screening tool (maximum 10.87% versus practice and other staged items); manual review, not a similarity cutoff, determined that no simple copy was identified. A longest-text-choice diagnostic with uniform random tie handling scored 19.66% over these 92 items, and authored positions were 23/22/23/24; these checks do not establish item quality or exam equivalence. This record covers exact staged artifacts; live validation will require root to integrate those same objects without edits."
